        <mxCell id="alignment_note" value="&lt;b&gt;C-05 GPA rule:&lt;/b&gt; read GPA_ENTRY rows and course credits from COURSE; resolve each numeric/letter input through GPA_SCALE; calculate credit-weighted term and cumulative GPA. Exactly one input mode is allowed per GPA entry. GPA is personal and non-official. Exact GPA_SCALE labels, score boundaries and points remain OPEN for TA confirmation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F5F8FB;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
